  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Scaling up EU&#xBF;s impact on gender equality in the Philippines</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The service contract will particularly : - &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;contribute to the implementation of EU Gender Action Plan III&#xBF;s country level implementation plan (CLIP) 2021-2025 for the Philippines, in particular on the following priority CLIP areas of engagement: promoting sexual and reproductive health and rights, ensuring freedom from all forms of gender-based violence (and access to justice), integrating the women, peace and security agenda.-&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;in the framework of the CLIP, support the EU Gender focal person group, the EU Delegation and the EU Member States in increasing the gender sensitiveness of their interventions and workplaces. -&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;support the Philippine women machinery in the implementation of its gender equality and women empowerment strategy.-&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;support the EU Delegation in its commitment of inclusive and participatory cooperation and partnership.</narrative>
  </description>
